{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence.makeIterator()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/makeiterator()"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V12makeIteratorAC0D0Vyx_GyF","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques.swift#L324","fileName":"MaximalCliques.swift"},"title":"makeIterator()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"makeIterator","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">.","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V8IteratorV","text":"Iterator","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Cliques"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"makeIterator"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","text":"MaximalCliques","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":">."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator","text":"Iterator","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V8IteratorV"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/makeIterator()"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/makeIterator()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/makeIterator()","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/makeiterator()","abstract":[],"title":"makeIterator()","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"makeIterator","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">.","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V8IteratorV","text":"Iterator","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MaximalCliques","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","role":"collection","title":"Cliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/Iterator":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/iterator","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Iterator","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"title":"MaximalCliques.Iterator","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Iterator","kind":"identifier"}]}}}